flowchart TD
    SearchStart([Search CLI]) --> SearchValidate[校验 keyword 与可选 type]
    SearchValidate -->|失败| SearchCLIError[CLI 记录一次 Error、打印 usage] --> SearchExitError([非零退出])
    SearchValidate -->|成功| Inspect[无锁 Inspect journal]
    Inspect -->|无 journal| Debug[可选 Debug]
    Inspect -->|合法活动 journal| Warn[Warn 并提示 apm fix]
    Inspect -->|损坏或不可读| Damaged[Warn journal 已损坏]
    Debug --> SearchCloudList[继续 Cloud List]
    Warn --> SearchCloudList
    Damaged --> SearchCloudList
    SearchCloudList -->|失败| SearchCLIError
    SearchCloudList -->|成功| SearchFilter[按名称 fold 和可选 type 筛选]
    SearchFilter --> SearchLatest[每个 Type/Name 选择最新 SemVer]
    SearchLatest --> SearchSort[按 Type、Name 稳定排序]
    SearchSort --> SearchResult[返回 SearchResult]
    SearchResult --> SearchRender[CLI renderer 输出 type/name@version]
    SearchRender -->|失败| SearchCLIError
    SearchRender -->|成功| SearchExitOK([正常退出])
